  "Scenes.DeepCave.SexualInterrogation.HandsClawRug": "His hands claw the rug underneath him as he gasps, [say: You win, you win! The desk has a-ah ah ahh-hidden drawer with a map to Lethice's hideout. Please justletmecomeletmecomeletmecomePLEAAAAASE!][pg]"
