  "Scenes.DeepCave.Vala.FreeIntro1": "You find an ugly iron key and open the rusted manacles with a teeth-clenching screech. The girl slumps to the ground, blinks slowly, and lifts her head to stare blankly at you. [say: How can Bitch please Master?] she asks in an innocent voice tainted by husky desire."
