  "Scenes.DeepCave.Vala.HealExit": "Vala flutters up to kiss your forehead and makes her exodus from the abyssal cavern. You feel like you've done a truly selfless thing in this den of iniquity."
  "Scenes.DeepCave.Vala.HealText": "You mix what you have into a draught and pour it down the faerie's throat. She thrashes wildly, then gradually calms. When she looks up, her eyes are clear at last. [say: Thank you. I am Vala. I was captured by the demons of this place and used to amuse them. You have saved me, and now it is all but a bad dream.]"
